1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,858
Sit-to-stand.

2
00:00:01,858 --> 00:00:02,718
It helps with getting

3
00:00:02,718 --> 00:00:04,250
up from any chair.

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,089
Scoot to the front

5
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:06,100
of your chair.

6
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,005
Feet flat,

7
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:08,972
about hip-width apart.

8
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,157
If you need help,

9
00:00:10,157 --> 00:00:10,934
put your hands on

10
00:00:10,934 --> 00:00:12,420
the chair and push.

11
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,024
That's a great

12
00:00:13,024 --> 00:00:14,562
way to start.

13
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,871
Lean forward,

14
00:00:15,871 --> 00:00:16,927
nose over toes…

15
00:00:16,927 --> 00:00:18,465
and stand up.

16
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,012
Now sit back down,

17
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:21,219
slowly.

18
00:00:21,219 --> 00:00:21,974
Reach back for the

19
00:00:21,974 --> 00:00:23,725
chair with your hips.

20
00:00:23,775 --> 00:00:24,732
Two.

21
00:00:26,325 --> 00:00:27,451
Take a breath whenever

22
00:00:27,451 --> 00:00:28,815
you need one.

23
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,193
Three.

24
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:34,819
Lovely.

25
00:00:34,819 --> 00:00:36,368
That's your last one.

